Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-First Episode\NThe Kingdom of the Seas\NTink and the Princess of the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is so vast and nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a baby turtle on the mama's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a little turtle on the mama's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Splash some water on them, splash, splash, splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep your head up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize and I'll forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You little runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll punch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Swish, swish, swish... And down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's not much, but I earned this money tending sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this, so please let Kogame-san go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only ten yen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.75,0:03:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's right to pick on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think fighting is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's right to bully the weak. I don't think it's right to bully the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought I'd save Kame-san
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and his friends, just like Urashima Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But it turned out the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, off to the Dragon Palace!\NThe Dragon Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to play with Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, Lord Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Urashima Taro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go to the Dragon Palace, I'll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just bear with it a little longer to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Dragon Palace is at the bottom of the sea, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that where you were? Wake up! Hey, wake up! Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this... the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Dragon Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So we really are at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not drowning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to the Dragon Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The elders and the Sea God are waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sea God?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the God of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A god?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharks! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear it, I hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship is passing overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sharks! Drag that ship down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can eat some crispy biscuits for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that tiny human you've got with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,T-This is my guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I look at it, the cuter this human is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it in my zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Anko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A little turtle and a rare creature came by, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to search you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Human food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Soggy, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so noisy! I can't even take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's thrashing around inside my stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And now my stomach hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to Dragon Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Gate Castle is really run-down, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It ended up like this because of those Sharks. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Sea God, we have guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Sea God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I told you that yelling will break the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome! Glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought Princess Otohime was at Dragon Gate Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Otohime is the Great Sea God's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so she really is here after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Otohime isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Neptune, the Sea God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem like a kind-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly don't seem like an ordinary human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a former angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a blessing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink, please save my daughter, Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come this way, Sir Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over here, Sir Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime is inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is Ankou here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ankou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.64,0:10:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir, right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give your consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it really bright, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a huge shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Otohime has shut herself inside that shell and won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a whole thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For a thousand years?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she lock herself in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Something terrible happened a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink, you are our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get my daughter out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kai-san, Kai-san, open your lid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's opening! It's opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kai-san, Kai-san, open it wider!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, close the shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime, w-wait... Otohime, don't close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kai-san, Kai-san, please open up. The Sea God wants to see Lady Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, open your shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:11:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're finally coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime, Otohime, why won't you come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you meddling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Sapphire here, I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,TINK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could Tink have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling lonely, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, I am Lord Sapphire's escort—that is to say, his bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no right to tell me to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I trail behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I just might get the chance to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,strike you down and send you to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Persistent and relentless—that's my best quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They say a turtle came to pick Tink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he headed out toward the open sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, where are you going in that beat-up boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a stroke of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That junk boat will sink before it even gets offshore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for Sapphire! Ah, what bliss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharks, you promised you wouldn't get rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well you're the one breaking your promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my promise! I definitely, definitely will!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.51,0:14:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,, As promised a thousand years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll give me Otohime as my bride, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,, Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,His bride?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I really love Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when will she show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,By the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless. I can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited a thousand years for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drag Otohime out my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to summon Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That nuisance is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.37,0:14:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please bring her out this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want her marrying someone like Sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid inside the shell because you didn't want to marry Sharks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, so don't come out no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A promise must always be kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you make such a foolish promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To stop Shark's tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He swore he'd stop picking on the weak fish
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if we gave him Otohime as his bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let them open that shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to protect the weak fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, turtles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.77,0:15:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all protect Lady Otohime together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for the weak little fish, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Let's all fight together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink doesn't know how terrifying the sharks are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship is passing above.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the ship down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring me some young maidens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope Tink is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope she is alive... She's a perfect young maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the Pearl of Forgetfulness. Forget everything, and do as I command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go. Now come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let the fashion show begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.11,0:16:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Young maiden,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,put on the latest high-fashion dress and walk the runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a lovely outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to show this to Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is magnificent! The absolute best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm so glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, save Lady Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Sea God, let's gather the fish and fight Sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of fighting. Can't Sir Tink do something with his powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll behave yourself once you're married, won't you, Sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Giving up without a fight...\N- I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.31,0:19:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Who needs a Sapphire like this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Her Highness the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.58,0:20:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you, Sharks, swear to take Otohime as your wife
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and live in peace without causing trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime, living with Sharks as your husband may seem impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but do you swear to endure it and live in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer already. I'm short-tempered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Swear to me, my Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up a good fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only tough when picking on the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm so glad I called you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.85,0:22:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In Urashima Taro,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,one day in the Dragon Palace equals 50 years in the human world...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That means 50 years will have passed when we get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.15,0:22:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take this treasure box with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will come in handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure box...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.76,0:22:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.53,0:22:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if all our friends have turned into old men by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.56,0:23:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.97,0:23:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm kind of scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me open the treasure box!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.04,0:23:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we open it, smoke might puff out and turn us into white-haired old folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't changed! What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a windfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.85,0:23:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire drowned at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make a fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.14,0:23:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.07,0:23:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, I thought you were dead—what is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.50,0:24:31.14,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:34.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:34.50,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
