Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:41.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:41.42,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
